      "content": "i know i'm not alone in feeling this way, but it doesn't change the fact that it's still me. i'm the one who has to wake up and do the act every single day. it's like i'm constantly running on empty and there's no recharge point for someone like me. it feels like i'm just wasting time waiting for something that's never gonna happen.",
